: 'Nexix network startup for QEMU user networking. Copy this file to'
: '/etc/netstart to configure the network at boot: init runs /etc/netstart'
: 'with sh after /etc/rc, with its output on the console. Without'
: '/etc/netstart only lo0 at 127.0.0.1 is ever configured. Upgrades keep'
: '/etc/netstart as it is. The V7 shell has no # comments, hence the colons.'
: 'Under make NIC=user this guest is 10.0.2.15 and the gateway 10.0.2.2.'
/sbin/ifconfig em0 10.0.2.15/24 up
/sbin/route add default 10.0.2.2
